{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Crystalkin (glassheart or shardmind) \n\r\nYou have learned to connect with other minds as easily as you connect ( or once connected) with the Mother Crystal by tapping into your nature as either a being of mind or a being of celestial light. You gain the following \r\nbenefits: \n\r\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\r\n- You can communicate telepathically with any creature you can see within 60 feet of you. You don\u0027t need to share a language with a creature for it to understand your telepathic utterances, but the creature must be able to understand at least one language. If you have telepathy from another source, the range is doubled, and the target can also respond to you telepathically. ","level":1}],"id":"Customec0f1911-1779-42fb-85a7-147308a520d8","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Crystal Telepathy [EAB]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}